WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.834
Joining us now is

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.634
former White House

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.402
ethics lawyer

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.336
Richard Painter

