00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.274
Richard, I just want to start with you,

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:08.842
counselor here,

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.343
because Paula was talking about this,

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.445
what we're seeing or not seeing,

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.014
