00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:18.752
by definition

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:19.352
is run

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.287
by the prosecutors and defense lawyers,

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.555
not even in the room.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.757
So how will the questioning

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.760
