00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.060
Well,

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.395
we don't know what's going to happen

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.229
and what

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.498
he's going to say to the grand jury.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.565
This investigation

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.101
has been going on for years.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.737
I submitted a amicus brief to the U.S.

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:38.571
Supreme Court

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.474
