00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.952
So law enforcement has to be prepared

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:01.354
they have to be coordinated.

00:07:01.354 --> 00:07:02.188
They have to have those

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:03.956
