00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.525
Hopefully, they never have to use it.

00:07:05.525 --> 00:07:06.225
Hopefully,

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:07.727
you know, the calls for peaceful

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:09.495
