00:08:39.418 --> 00:08:42.121
from that attorney client relationship,

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:43.856
apparently saying that Cohen

00:08:43.856 --> 00:08:45.958
was telling a different story

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.193
before he cooperated.

00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:49.529
But John we know that already.

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.631
Cohen has admitted to that.

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:52.999
So they'll bring in

00:08:52.999 --> 00:08:55.234
Cohen, possibly if Costello

00:08:56.736 --> 00:08:58.437
needs to be rebutted.

00:08:58.437 --> 00:09:01.274
To say yes, I wasn't candid before.

00:09:01.274 --> 00:09:03.743
I've cooperated. I've been candid since.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.144
I've analyzed

00:09:05.144 --> 00:09:06.178
Cohen's statements

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:08.114
since he began cooperating

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:10.316
and they have been rock solid.

00:09:10.316 --> 00:09:12.618
He's told the same account

00:09:12.618 --> 00:09:14.720
about the president's hush money

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.790
to influence the 2016 election.

